%% Sequence: Socratic Spacer Idle-Detection Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Writer
    participant FE as React + Tiptap
    participant ID as Idle Detector<br/>(frontend timer)
    participant GW as FastAPI Gateway
    participant SOC as Socratic Spacer Engine
    participant AI as AIService (Gemini)
    participant SSE as SSE Push Service
    participant DB as Postgres

    Note over U,FE: Writer stops typing for 45s
    U->>FE: (inactivity - no keystrokes)
    FE->>ID: keystroke timer expires<br/>(threshold: 45s)
    ID->>FE: emit idle event with<br/>current paragraph context
    FE->>GW: POST /socratic-spacer<br/>{project_id, paragraph_id,<br/>last_text, cursor_position}
    GW->>GW: JWT + rate limit
    GW->>SOC: generate_ghost_question()
    SOC->>SOC: Build context window<br/>(last 3 paragraphs +<br/>current paragraph stub)
    SOC->>AI: Generate Socratic question<br/>(prompt template: [Provocation])
    AI-->>SOC: "What evidence would<br/>make this claim false?"
    SOC->>SSE: push intervention<br/>(type=socratic, intervention_id)
    SOC->>DB: INSERT intervention<br/>(status=active)
    SSE-->>FE: SSE event:<br/>intervention payload
    FE->>FE: Render ghost question<br/>in Living Margin (dimmed,<br/>non-blocking)
    FE-->>U: Margin shows ghost question:<br/>"What evidence would<br/>make this claim false?"
    
    alt Writer engages with question
        U->>FE: Clicks "Explore this"
        FE->>GW: PATCH /interventions/{id}<br/>{action: "engaged"}
        GW->>DB: UPDATE intervention<br/>SET user_action='engaged'
        FE-->>U: Question promotes to<br/>primary intervention card
    else Writer dismisses
        U->>FE: Clicks "Dismiss"
        FE->>GW: PATCH /interventions/{id}<br/>{action: "dismissed"}
        GW->>DB: UPDATE intervention<br/>SET user_action='dismissed'
        FE-->>U: Margin clears ghost question
    else Writer keeps typing (ignores)
        U->>FE: Resumes typing
        FE->>ID: Reset idle timer
        Note over FE: Ghost question auto-fades<br/>after 90s of inactivity
    end
